SRE Tip

Run three separate tests:

Cold Start Test (first request after deployment)
Steady-State Test (10-20 concurrent users)
Stress Test (increase concurrency until latency spikes or errors appear)

The point where P95 latency grows rapidly or errors begin appearing is your practical scaling threshold and should be documented before production rollout.


